<title>NEW ZEALAND: Energy recommends Radio Pacific offer.</title>
<headline>Energy recommends Radio Pacific offer.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy Enterprises said on Wednesday its board would recommend to shareholders that they accept the full takeover offer from Radio Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Radio Pacific is offering NZ$3.60 for each Energy share, or six of its own shares for five Energy shares.</p>
<p>Energy is an unlisted company with radio stations in New Plymouth, Tauranga and Hamilton.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
